    "Second Charleston, the last pass, going RIGHT. On an earlier left pass your right-hand neighbor handed you three winds, so they are probably not on Winds and Dragons.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zweiter Charleston, letzter Pass, nach RECHTS. Im früheren Linkspass hat dir dein rechter Nachbar drei Winde gegeben, er spielt also wohl nicht auf Winde & Drachen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Segundo Charleston, último pase, a la DERECHA. En un pase anterior a la izquierda, tu vecino de la derecha te pasó tres vientos, así que probablemente no va por Vientos y Dragones."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Second Charleston, dernière passe, vers la DROITE. Lors d'une passe à gauche précédente, votre voisin de droite vous a donné trois vents : il ne vise donc probablement pas Vents et Dragons."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Charleston kedua, operan terakhir, ke KANAN. Pada operan kiri sebelumnya, tetangga kananmu memberimu tiga angin, jadi mereka mungkin tidak mengincar Angin dan Naga."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Charleston thứ hai, lượt cuối, chuyền sang PHẢI. Ở lượt chuyền trái trước đó, hàng xóm bên phải đã đưa bạn ba quân gió, nên họ có lẽ không theo Gió & Rồng."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Second Charleston, the last pass, going RIGHT. On an earlier left pass your right-hand neighbor handed you three winds, so they are probably not on Winds and Dragons. Pick 3.": {
